- Previous Permitted Use: "Social, Domestic & Pleasure"
- New Permitted Use: "Business Use (Class 1) incl. SDP & Commuting"

Excluded from Business Use (Class 1) (as stated):
- use as a taxi or hire vehicle;
- carrying goods for reward;
- use for racing, rallying, pace-making, or speed testing;
- commercial travelling involving calling on multiple business premises as the primary purpose of each journey.

Who is covered for business use:
- Only the policyholder is covered for business use under this endorsement (Business Use Class 1 does not cover Named Drivers).
